{"4046720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gloxinia", "steam_appid": 4046720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gloxinia is a rhythm dancing game telling a mysterious story of queer love, loss, and larceny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving a mysterious flower petal in the mail, you wake up in an unfamiliar but alluring nightclub, surrounded by gorgeous strangers. You must figure out why you've come here, who they are, and who YOU are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to hone your rhythm and pay close attention to learn dance moves from the various strangers. Inspired by the amazing Space Channel 5, you'll need to learn sequences and repeat them in rhythm. You may even find yourself behind the wheel of a car, on horseback, or flying, but you'll need to keep the beat no matter what.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gloxinia features a cast of human FMV performers inside a visually unique world.  If you can dance your way into their good graces, you may discover a forgotten history together that takes you on a campy journey through the American west.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels featuring 30 original and licensed tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 real FMV actors (no AI here!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty settings for each level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon to PC/Mac/Linux/Steam Deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gloxinia is a rhythm dancing game telling a mysterious story of queer love, loss, and larceny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving a mysterious flower petal in the mail, you wake up in an unfamiliar but alluring nightclub, surrounded by gorgeous strangers. You must figure out why you've come here, who they are, and who YOU are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to hone your rhythm and pay close attention to learn dance moves from the various strangers. Inspired by the amazing Space Channel 5, you'll need to learn sequences and repeat them in rhythm. You may even find yourself behind the wheel of a car, on horseback, or flying, but you'll need to keep the beat no matter what.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gloxinia features a cast of human FMV performers inside a visually unique world.  If you can dance your way into their good graces, you may discover a forgotten history together that takes you on a campy journey through the American west.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels featuring 30 original and licensed tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 real FMV actors (no AI here!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty settings for each level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon to PC/Mac/Linux/Steam Deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A rhythm dancing FMV game telling a mysterious story of love, loss, and larceny. Learn choreography and repeat it back to sexy strangers to discover a hidden past.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046720/5adef090ed6cff599f3d013c3a99b717ce498500/header.jpg?t=1768422881", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046720/9787f523e118bd5ad1635dece06fbd99487f665b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768422881", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046720/9787f523e118bd5ad1635dece06fb